    { question: "Is robotic surgery accessible to everyone in India?", answer: "While robotic surgery is advanced and typically expensive, institutions like NIMS Hyderabad are making it more accessible. By performing over 90% of robotic surgeries free under government health schemes, they are significantly bridging the access gap for economically disadvantaged patients in India." }
