    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual split image. On the left, a sleek, open foldable smartphone, displaying a minimalist interface, radiating an aura of sophisticated normalcy and integration into daily life, signifying its maturity. The phone is subtly illuminated with soft, cool tones. On the right, an Xbox Series X console, slightly elevated on a stylized platform, with abstract upward-trending red lines or glowing orange embers around its base, symbolizing a significant price increase and market heat. The console is rendered with slightly darker, warmer tones. A faint, interwoven digital circuitry pattern subtly connects the two distinct scenes, against a clean, modern tech-inspired background with a subtle, abstract global map overlay to hint at international impact. The overall aesthetic should be polished, thought-provoking, and not overly futuristic, maintaining a news-editorial feel.",
