    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing global higher education under intense scrutiny. The image features a stylized globe subtly showcasing continents (India, US, UK, Nepal prominent). Surrounding the globe are abstract elements symbolizing regulation and oversight: a magnifying glass hovering over university buildings, policy documents unfurling, and scales of justice balancing books. Student figures from diverse backgrounds are depicted, looking towards the globe, emphasizing the human impact. The color palette is professional and serious, with deep blues, grays, and subtle accents of gold, maintaining a clean, modern aesthetic with soft light gradients. The composition is dynamic, showing interconnectedness.",
