    featuredImagePrompt: "A dynamic, conceptual visual representing explosive growth and investment in AI. Imagine intertwined abstract circuits and glowing data streams forming a rising graph or a stylized 'unicorn' horn, with subtle outlines of global cityscapes (London, Bengaluru, New York) in the background, implying global tech hubs. Use a vibrant color palette of blues, purples, and golds, emphasizing innovation and wealth generation. The composition should be futuristic and energetic, conveying rapid acceleration and high stakes without being literal or cartoonish. Focus on digital abstract elements rather than human figures or specific company logos. The perspective should be slightly elevated, looking towards a soaring digital future.",
