    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual, data-driven visual representing the intertwined global tech market. On one side, subtle outlines of a U.S. skyline with digital data streams flowing across a stylized globe towards a Korean cityscape. On the other side, a graph showing mixed stock performance with an upward trend for 'profits' and a plateau for 'outlook.' Below, an infographic element showing a compact, modern retail store alongside an electric vehicle with an unusual price tag arrow pointing upwards, defying a typical depreciation curve. Use a clean, professional aesthetic with a palette of blues, greens, and subtle golds, emphasizing interconnectedness and data. Ensure elements are distinct but visually linked, suitable for a news article on market dynamics. Industry-specific visual style.",
