    featuredImagePrompt: "A dynamic editorial news layout. On the left, a golden Oscar statue shimmering with a soft spotlight, subtly reflecting diverse, celebratory faces in its surface. On the right, a stylized, action-packed image of Spider-Man (Tom Holland's version) in mid-swing, silhouetted against a futuristic city skyline at twilight. Below Spider-Man, digital text displays '$72M Domestic Preview Record'. A bold, elegant headline like 'Entertainment Triumphs: A New Era' is centrally placed, bridging the two visuals. The overall composition should be high-impact, premium, and visually rich, incorporating elements relevant to film awards and blockbuster success, with a celebratory and analytical feel.",
